| **Avg.** |      19      |        16        |          470         | **505**   |  2,674   | 3,354  |
| **Mdn.** |       1      |         1        |          111         | **150**   |  3,600   | 3,600  |

OTABLE
echo '</artisan_submit>'
EOF
